      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aurora%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Aurora is home to the Aurora Fossil Museum, which showcases fossils collected from the local PCS Phosphate Mine.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
