      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aurora%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The museum’s collection includes marine fossils from the Pleistocene, Pliocene, and Miocene epochs.",
